  "description": "HighlightLabel.Maui is a powerful, lightweight, and high-performance .NET MAUI control designed to automatically highlight specific text matches within a string. Perfect for search autocomplete lists, filter systems, and real-time query suggestions. Features seamless data binding, case-insensitive evaluation via optimized Regex tokenization, custom highlight coloration, bold emphasis triggers, and cross-platform layout rendering without UI thread blocking or performance degradation in large text and large CollectionViews.",
